      "path": "/Users/me/src/shop/docs/checkout-retries.md",
      "title": "Checkout retries",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"checkout-retries\">Checkout retries</h1>\n<p>Status: draft for approval. Follows the <a href=\"clubmate-doc:/Users/me/src/shop/docs/payments.md#charge\">payments overview</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"why\">Why</h2>\n<p>The <strong>charge</strong> step fails about 0.4% of the time on a provider timeout. Today the cart is released and the user starts over.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><input checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> measure timeouts per provider</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> retry with the same idempotency key</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> surface <del>a generic error</del> the provider's reason</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"flow\">Flow</h2>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\">flowchart LR\n  V[validate] --&gt; R[reserve] --&gt; C{charge}\n  C --&gt;|ok| D[done]\n  C --&gt;|timeout| W[wait 2 s] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|declined| X[release stock]</pre>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant App\n  participant Shop\n  participant Provider\n  App-&gt;&gt;Shop: POST /checkout\n  Shop-&gt;&gt;Provider: charge(key)\n  Provider--&gt;&gt;Shop: timeout\n  Shop-&gt;&gt;Provider: charge(key) again\n  Provider--&gt;&gt;Shop: ok\n  Shop--&gt;&gt;App: 200</pre>\n<h2 id=\"limits\">Limits</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Provider</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Timeout</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Retries</th>\n<th>Backoff</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Stripe</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">10 s</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2</td>\n<td>2 s, 5 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adyen</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15 s</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n<td>5 s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"code\">Code</h2>\n<pre class=\"chroma\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"kd\">func</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">charge</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">ctx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">context</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Context</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Provider</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">key</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">string</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"w\">\t</span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">attempt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">range</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">err</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">p</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">Charge</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">ctx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">key</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">!</span><span class=\"nx\">errors</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">Is</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">err</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ErrTimeout</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"w\">\t\t\t</span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">err</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"w\">\t\t</span><span class=\"nx\">time</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nf\">Sleep</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">backoff</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">attempt</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"w\">\t</span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"w\">\t</span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ErrTimeout</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"cl\"><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\">\n</span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id=\"open-questions\">Open questions</h2>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\">flowchart TD\n  A --&gt; </pre>\n<p>Should a declined card retry once? See the <a href=\"https://stripe.com/docs/error-codes\">provider docs</a> and <code>cart/charge.go</code>.<sup id=\"fnref:1\"><a href=\"#fn:1\" class=\"footnote-ref\" role=\"doc-noteref\">1</a></sup></p>\n<div class=\"footnotes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\">\n<hr>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:1\">\n<p>Retries never change the amount.&#160;<a href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-backref\" role=\"doc-backlink\">&#x21a9;&#xfe0e;</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/Users/me/src/shop/docs/payments.md",
      "title": "Payments overview",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"payments-overview\">Payments overview</h1>\n<p>Back to <a href=\"clubmate-doc:/Users/me/src/shop/docs/checkout-retries.md\">checkout retries</a>. See <a href=\"clubmate-doc:/Users/me/src/shop/docs/conversion.html\">conversion</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"charge\">Charge</h2>\n<p>The charge step calls the provider once per order with an idempotency key, so a retry never charges twice.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A provider timeout is not a decline: the money may have moved.</p>\n</blockquote>\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/Users/me/src/shop/docs/conversion.html",
      "title": "Checkout conversion",
      "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Checkout conversion</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<style>\nbody { margin: 0; padding: 20px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: var(--font); }\nh1 { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 4px; }\np { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 16px; }\na { color: var(--accent); }\nbutton { font: inherit; color: var(--text); background: var(--code-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 12px; }\n.chart { position: relative; height: 280px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n</style></head>\n<body>\n<h1>Checkout conversion</h1>\n<p>Orders per week with and without charge retries. Details in <a href=\"checkout-retries.md\">checkout retries</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"chart\"><canvas id=\"chart\"></canvas></div>\n<button id=\"toggle\">Hide retries</button>\n<script>\nconst css = name => getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(name).trim();\nconst chart = new Chart(document.getElementById('chart'), {\n  type: 'bar',\n  data: {\n    labels: ['W40', 'W41', 'W42', 'W43', 'W44'],\n    datasets: [\n      { label: 'No retries', data: [812, 790, 845, 830, 801], backgroundColor: css('--muted') },\n      { label: 'With retries', data: [846, 828, 881, 870, 842], backgroundColor: css('--accent') },\n    ],\n  },\n  options: {\n    maintainAspectRatio: false,\n    color: css('--text'),\n    scales: {\n      x: { ticks: { color: css('--muted') }, grid: { color: css('--border') } },\n      y: { ticks: { color: css('--muted') }, grid: { color: css('--border') } },\n    },\n  },\n});\ndocument.getElementById('toggle').addEventListener('click', event => {\n  const visible = chart.isDatasetVisible(1);\n  chart.setDatasetVisibility(1, !visible);\n  chart.update();\n  event.target.textContent = visible ? 'Show retries' : 'Hide retries';\n});\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
      "kind": "artifact"
    },
